{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vEjptrf0aY1794570533.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>為配合在深圳舉行的亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議，本港將設立臨時限制飛行區。</p><p></p><p>由下周二凌晨至下周五期間，新界北部禁止無人機、滑翔傘、風箏及放飛大量氣球，而全港空域亦限制所有直升機及小型飛機飛行。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.APEC.DRONE-1830-1_CLEAN_20261113_193601_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026o3MNtqjNfF1794570543.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>民航處已知會航空公司及機師，又提醒任何人如在沒有特別批准下，在臨時限制飛行區內進行飛行活動，即屬違法。一經定罪，可被判罰款及監禁。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:21:15.439370+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:23.281682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:34.965844+00:00","content_hash":"0aaec49870fe32a59e25c110e5086c43ec177fd308331a01991b47131b48b8d3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:21:15.439370+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}